ue},{"name":"暴击率","values":[12,12],"unit":"%"},{"name":"防御","values":[33,36],"baseValues":[33.048,36.288000000000004],"grows":true}],"growthRate":1.02,"mainOptions":[{"name":"生命","min":8.0,"max":20.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"防御","min":6.0,"max":18.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"武器技能恢复速度","min":4.0,"max":18.0,"unit":"%"}],"subOptions":[{"name":"技能伤害值","min":5.0,"max":20.0,"unit":"%"}],"subCount":[0,1],"limitBreak":[{"name":"攻击","min":10.0,"max":10.0,"unit":"%"}],"engrave":[{"name":"攻击","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"engraveRandom":[{"name":"生命","unit":"%","values":[3.0,6.0,9.0,12.0,15.0]}],"effects":[{"name":"忘我之境","description":"仙山拳攻击范围增大50%，按照双拳攻击伤害值的100%恢复生命。"}],"skill":{"name":"霸王冰焰弹","description":"发射寒冰与烈火融合而成的冰焰弹，对前方敌人造成近程伤害，并附带击倒效果。","levels":[2,5],"damage":[160.0,220.0],"cooldown":[8.5,8.5],"ailment":"击倒"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":[20],"Height":[176],"Weight":[72]},"tribes":["人类"],"story":"佩儿，在消逝之都传承仙山拳法，师承神威门掌门陶禹。\n\n原是武林星河派正一门的弟子，因身份低微，遭到其他师兄弟的歧视，后离开正一门拜师陶禹。自己受了不少委屈，仍坚信人类的善良及其影响力，对善能胜恶的信念异常坚定。\n\n为了不像瞧不起自己的人一样犯错，举止有礼，慎重待人。天生为人谦虚，注重礼节。平时严肃认真、沉着冷静的态度，在见到小动物，与其搭话时变得无比亲切。认为没有人能真正理解动物们不能言语的无奈之心，待它们极为友善。","storyKey":"profile_china_boy_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=52","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=52","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"]},"voiceLines":[{"id":"china_hero_boy","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["真正的侠义永不言败…"],"enUS":["True warriors never lose."],"jaJP":["真の漢とは、負けを知らぬものだ"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_NormalBattleWin"]},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["碰上我，算你倒霉。"],"enUS":["You're luck ended when you faced me."],"jaJP":["拙者に相まみえた事が運の尽きだったな"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_BossBattleWin"]},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["这就是…我的结局吗？"],"enUS":["Is this… My end…?"],"jaJP":["拙者の最後は…この程度のものだったか…"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_Die"]},{"type":"GetExp","label":"获得经验结晶","texts":{"zhCN":["多吃一点这个，我就能变强吗…？"],"enUS":["Eating this will make me strong…?"],"jaJP":["食べ続ければ強くなる、だと…？"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_GetExp"]},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["真的变强了…难以置信…！"],"enUS":["I feel stronger… Amazing…!"],"jaJP":["本当に強くなった… 驚いたな…！"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_LevelUp"]},{"type":"EquipWeapon","label":"佩戴装备","texts":{"zhCN":["这…呵，挺好的，多谢了。"],"enUS":["This… Is good. I'll use it well."],"jaJP":["これは… 悪くないな、使わせてもらう"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_EquipWeapon"]},{"type":"EquipCostume","label":"穿戴时装","texts":{"zhCN":["新衣裳？嗯，不错。"],"enUS":["New clothing? Not bad."],"jaJP":["新しい服か、うむ、悪くないな"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_EquipCostume"]},{"type":"Evolve","label":"进化","texts":{"zhCN":["难道这就是师傅之前说的境界吗？"],"enUS":["Is this the elevated state that Master Tao spoke of?"],"jaJP":["師匠の言った境地とは、このことだったのか！"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_Evolve"]},{"type":"Attack1","label":"攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["呼！"],"enUS":["Hup!"],"jaJP":["ふっ！"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_Attack1"]},{"type":"Attack2","label":"攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["哈呀！"],"enUS":["Haat!"],"jaJP":["はっ！"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_Attack2"]},{"type":"Attack3","label":"攻击3","texts":{"zhCN":["破绽百出！"],"enUS":["You are open!"],"jaJP":["隙あり！"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_Attack3"]},{"type":"Skill1","label":"技能1","texts":{"zhCN":["挥拳，毫不犹豫！"],"enUS":["My fist has no hesitation!"],"jaJP":["この一突き、一点の迷いなし！"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_Skill1"]},{"type":"Skill2","label":"技能2","texts":{"zhCN":["看，这就是仙山拳奥义！"],"enUS":["Behold! The Shen Mountain Fist!"],"jaJP":["見よ、これが仙山拳奥義！"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_Skill2"]},{"type":"Damaged1","label":"受到攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["呃！"],"enUS":["Ugh!"],"jaJP":["くっ！"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_Damaged1"]},{"type":"Damaged2","label":"受到攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["咳呃！"],"enUS":["Huhh!"],"jaJP":["がはっ！"]},"keys":["cv_china_hero_boy_Damaged2"]},